<title>USA: Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placements of broiler chicks in the 15 major producing states in the week ended April 19 totalled 136.225 million, versus a revised 137.586 million in the previous week and 131.473 million a year ago, the U.S. Agriculture Department said.</p>
<p>Eggs set in those states in the same week totalled 173.893 million, versus a revised 173.143 million the previous week and 166,621 million in the comparable week of last year, USDA said.</p>
</text>
